<title>FRANCE: France sells 23.82 bln Ffr 2002 BTANs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 23.82 bln Ffr 2002 BTANs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (BTANs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 12.MAR.02	4.75	 23.815 BLN	  4.47</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 43.625 BLN/1.8		   395 MLN	   101.20</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 40.00						   12.MAR</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							   20.MAR</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell between 22 and 24 billion francs of BTANs in total today.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
